    {
      "type": "heading",
      "id": "la-ch06-item-1-3-1",
      "sourceStart": 1721,
      "sourceEnd": 1844,
      "original": "#### 1.3.1. If $U$ is a subset of $V$, then the orthogonal complement of $U$ is denoted by $U^{\\perp}$, defined as follows.",
      "action": "moved-to-item-title-and-statement"
    },
    {
      "type": "body",
