    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "id": "la-ch06-item-1-3-2",
      "sourceStart": 1993,
      "sourceEnd": 2168,
      "original": "#### 1.3.2. Let $V$ be an inner product space and let $U$ be a finite-dimensional subspace of $V$. Then the orthogonal projection $P_U\\in\\mathcal{L}(V)$ is defined as follows.",
      "action": "moved-to-item-title-and-statement"
    },
    {
