      "sourceStart": 3814,
      "sourceEnd": 3964,
      "original": "#### 2.2.2. <span style=\"color: red\">(Bessel’s inequality)</span> Suppose $e_1,\\ldots,e_n$ is an orthonormal list of vectors in $V$. If $v\\in V$, then",
