      "sourceStart": 4421,
      "sourceEnd": 4606,
      "original": "#### 2.2.4. <span style=\"color: red\">(Gram-Schmidt Procedure)</span> Suppose $v_1,\\ldots,v_m$ is a list of linearly independent vectors in $V$. Let $f_1=v_1$. For $k=2,\\ldots,m$, define",
      "action": "moved-to-item-title-and-statement"
