      "sourceStart": 5391,
      "sourceEnd": 5753,
      "sha256": "3b1df9bc7ba76fd32f16ec663850c61bf04f841c64beeea2c4b336e568b5c412"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "id": "la-ch06-item-2-2-6",
      "sourceStart": 5753,
      "sourceEnd": 5979,
      "original": "#### 2.2.6. <span style=\"color: red\">(Riesz representation theorem)</span> Suppose $V$ is finite-dimensional inner product space and $\\varphi$ is a linear functional on $V$. Then there exists a unique vector $v\\in V$ such that",
